# An atom, which takes the data of its ρ and of its argument.
#
#   ⟦ int ↦ ⟦ times ↦ ⟦ ρ ↦ ∅, x ↦ ∅, λ ⤍ L_times ⟧, Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-06 ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.int.times(x ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-07 ⟧) ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.169.

F c0 int foo
F c1 times
F c2 ρ x
λ c2 L_times
P c1 times c2
Δ c1 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-06
P c0 int c1
D c3 c0 int
D c4 c3 times
F c5
Δ c5 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-07
A c6 c4 x c5
P c0 foo c6
